Package: myscoutee-registry
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MyScoutee <admin@myscoutee.local>
Depends: bash, coreutils, jq, openssl, systemd, tar, docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose-plugin | docker-compose-v2
Description: MyScoutee Registry controlled production stack
 Installs the self-contained, pull-free MyScoutee Registry production stack.
 The Go registry and Nginx TLS edge remain separate Docker images. Operator
 configuration, TLS material, registry keys, and persistent state are not
 embedded in the package.
